      "This is why Fortune 500 companies, luxury wedding planners, and the most discerning private hosts in the country specifically request close-up magic for cocktail hour. It's not about the tricks. It's about what happens between the tricks: real human connection, joy, and the feeling that something special is happening right here, right now. If you're curious what format would work best for your cocktail hour, our <a href='/quiz'>35-second quiz</a> can point you in the right direction.",
