      "The magic scene in Las Vegas is more vibrant than it has ever been. Whether you're drawn to the grand spectacle of a theater show or the intimate impossibility of close-up magic performed inches from your face, Vegas delivers. And if you leave the city wondering what it would be like to have that kind of magic at your own event, that's exactly the experience White Rabbit brings to private gatherings, corporate events, and celebrations across the country.",
